  "description": "A cram school dormitory in the height of summer. Before Gwang-Tae, who has turned his back on the world and is just getting by, appears Bo-Ae, a girl who longs to exist in this world. Amid the stifling heat in a corner of the dormitory, Gwang-Tae’s stagnant life begins to stir with the arrival of Bo-Ae.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
